{"direct":{"A river full of letters":"msg.6e8fa4faa915b38d","THE OLD QUAY":"msg.78b29ff619d08b0f","Late afternoon":"msg.1503dd476341b127","The rain has stopped. Nine letters have slipped from a bicycle basket into the Uzh. There is still time to bring them home.":"msg.ed25d408ce2b7f2d","Three doors open. Somewhere behind the quay, a kettle begins to sing.":"msg.ebccd8a94a3b29ed","A book with your name in it":"msg.7a7630eb4126eda0","Marta · the bookshop":"msg.01ad17912effb31c","I found the book you lent me, with the tram ticket still between its pages. You said there was no hurry. Twenty years seems long enough. I will come by before you close.":"msg.c44d76a767e05dcd","Leave a place by the window.":"msg.bf42ca5be8444e35","Put the kettle on.":"msg.f4ca4c1080d40fdc","A chair waits in the last square of sunlight.":"msg.30aab618138e326a","The first cup is already warming.":"msg.e803ff09c4ca1812","The things that come back":"msg.343846e31b5f3930","Olena · the riverside garden":"msg.3b7486332d9cee74","The cutting you gave me has outgrown every pot I own. I am bringing a piece of it home. Perhaps we can plant it where the old bench used to be.":"msg.dfa7e2eb0025542a","There is room beside the bench.":"msg.4206dd22bbf3a083","Bring your largest pot.":"msg.bf14053b3ae9534b","Roots find their way into familiar ground.":"msg.bc9bd1e03130e9dc","Some things need a little room to travel.":"msg.b5080210bcceb26b","Before the lights come on":"msg.b11df28af35e02f1","Danylo · the lamplighter’s landing":"msg.5d3e6478b7457464","I kept meaning to tell you that I watch for your lamp each evening. When it comes on, this side of the river feels less far away. Tonight I will bring two chairs.":"msg.d7c547a5b1777fc3","I will bring a blanket.":"msg.602ce3b92346df81","I will leave the lamp on.":"msg.91a76f7d513c5522","There is enough blanket for two.":"msg.d6652ffb07497df6","A small light can be an invitation.":"msg.1cd8407707946121","Where the willows lean":"msg.6ad0c9ff64cdb2ee","THE RIVERSIDE GARDEN":"msg.6d5c2c0dd50b960f","Blue hour":"msg.cb2b7eedf469e383","The current carries you beyond the quay. Under the willows, the last raindrops are letting go.":"msg.aa20a275452591bb","The garden grows quiet. On the far bank, the first windows turn gold.":"msg.f783f75a41ce5664","The unfinished page":"msg.b5d68a3fcb342907","Marta · the garden reading room":"msg.0211653a0bfe26d4","I could never remember how your story ended. The girl found the river, and then what? I have written three endings on the back. Keep the one you like, or write another.":"msg.c74ac087d26c4cee","Let her keep walking.":"msg.b0a9a3dea4e61340","Let her come home.":"msg.d1849e3717af1266","A new page, and a little more river.":"msg.2301ca3f90dd8c76","The path home is also an adventure.":"msg.a8f2fe9f823820ed","A small instruction":"msg.c2f50152ed4ae3d7","Olena · the greenhouse steps":"msg.11bb2d634285fcf6","Do not cut back the untidy corner yet. There is a nest in the ivy. I saw one small head this morning, then another. The garden can wait a week.":"msg.4ee248d447d30361","We can wait.":"msg.4d09899212f2a8b0","I will move the bench closer.":"msg.fd336a363c9e968f","For a week, the ivy belongs to someone else.":"msg.d1f6817d470a98e9","A quiet seat with the best view in town.":"msg.583390313adadc31","The spare key":"msg.6d6a9f211057d0cf","Danylo · the willow landing":"msg.b995444d74704c08","The key is under the blue pot, as always. If I am late, let yourself in. There is soup on the stove. You do not have to knock every time.":"msg.39fd2771e8ce05ab","I will bring bread.":"msg.241d3ce5c114266b","I will wash the bowls.":"msg.1fbd3c2949ead4f3","A loaf is easier to carry than an apology.":"msg.b215807cdd8c618d","The smallest jobs say: I am staying.":"msg.42d1092c7a52ca5f","The other side of evening":"msg.8861317f96612464","THE FOOTBRIDGE":"msg.3981520ba127594f","Nightfall":"msg.dcf117082063c69b","The river darkens. Three pale envelopes are still turning in the current. Across the water, someone is waiting.":"msg.a1040c914d26313a","Nine letters. Nine small distances made shorter. The river keeps moving; tonight, so do the stories.":"msg.3dd2c6d5183fb9d6","Tomorrow, if it is fine":"msg.c0d5e9f5da8d8ac2","Marta · the bridge bookstall":"msg.96bd6ab9b48594fa","Let us take the long way tomorrow. No errands. No list. We can stop at the bookstall, or not. I would like a whole afternoon with nowhere else to be.":"msg.e102439d72932bb1","The long way, then.":"msg.973990baa34e5e0a","Even if it rains.":"msg.26f6671b45bba7e1","Tomorrow has room in it.":"msg.b3d99a58f7976252","There are worse things than a little rain.":"msg.2d0cfd29ca9eb260","What we planted":"msg.8d9ac468fb302ac4","Olena · the night garden":"msg.3472d36da16e8ad1","I walked past our tree. It is taller than the house now. I stood under it for a while and thought about how certain we were that it would never grow.":"msg.385ac56cb71af8ef","Come and see it with me.":"msg.a30931ec797e5b30","There is room for another.":"msg.627c5780307d896d","Some years are easier to count in leaves.":"msg.2a8ca2b86da2c1db","A small hole in the ground. Another beginning.":"msg.157449aced454fff","This side of the river":"msg.0223fe15569403fe","Danylo · the last light":"msg.ad38d025b2d97618","I can see your window from here. I was going to write something important, but perhaps this is enough: I am here. The light is on. Come over when you are ready.":"msg.ff5fb906e6fe60a3","I am on my way.":"msg.746272fdca4927ba","Save me the chair by the light.":"msg.936070dccc6dcf91","A short crossing, at last.":"msg.41cfcf675751a70b","One chair. One warm window. Enough.":"msg.b1eadd090bfbf939","This device could not save. You can keep sailing.":"msg.4d72ffa7059416f7","Sail closer to a landing, then press E.":"msg.0274f6637eb33e82","Find the drifting letter with this landing’s seal.":"msg.a57deaa830b3d67d","This letter is home. Find the next pale envelope on the water.":"msg.b673e7a7ed33dd71","painted river scenes and mail boat":"msg.9167825b138f6f6a","A letter for {v0}.":"msg.8315466a09b15ba0","A letter for ":"msg.65518a80ef363a7a","Recover letter":"msg.a8102a3938a46ede","Sail to {v0}":"msg.abe6d202ca44260f","Sail to ":"msg.8e4c3d440243252f","Delivered":"msg.906115657390f367","UZHHOROD":"msg.a1e93474de3b369f","Letters":"msg.0b438c8abb4dba92"," / 3 letters home":"msg.1364e814cc7ea5d8","{v0} / 3 letters home":"msg.0fde9914d41c9efd","WASD / arrows · steer    E · deliver    Space · slow":"msg.d719a108260126df"," / 3 home":"msg.a6e2c5a6ce15e566","{v0} / 3 home":"msg.6867f26e63bf13b9","Deliver letter  →":"msg.af4d0608febdbcf3","Tap the water to sail. Find a pale envelope.":"msg.3dc477a1bf645e62","Click the water or use WASD to sail. Recover a pale envelope, then follow its seal to a landing.":"msg.5c0f7503e099a9f8","River overview":"msg.d90daf07992462d8","A RIVER STORY":"msg.95080e58bf70cbbd","Uzhhorod":"msg.3837cdaef96fd4f3","After the Rain":"msg.cf6d659502a3d43a","A little boat. A handful of lost letters. A city waiting on the other side of the water.":"msg.13c0b5ac3854ab6d","Art could not load":"msg.39c969058dafcfd9","Preparing the river…":"msg.f406c5ef1b01c131","Return to the river  →":"msg.ac0b41433c1ab290","Continue your journey  →":"msg.95d967eebf2dc3a3","Cast off  →":"msg.0acd6fa0d2cdf436","STEER SLOWLY. BRING SOMETHING HOME.":"msg.774e3337c3cf97aa","01 — 03   /   A QUIET ADVENTURE":"msg.888df748afae32e2","Sound off":"msg.3f5d70944c3f9e2d","Sound on":"msg.8c477e13ad004984","CHAPTER 0":"msg.e1b72aaa6f077bc3","CHAPTER 0{v0}":"msg.11905be4d0405960","Take to the water  →":"msg.bced6ab93bd5e070","Find the letters. Match their seals to the landings.":"msg.932da290cd55b35d","LETTER 0":"msg.7803f9d4b2f15700","LETTER 0{v0}":"msg.c2a964d8be27d23f","LEAVE A SMALL REPLY":"msg.7a264a254856f11c","THREE LETTERS HOME":"msg.bbe37d5c86fd627b","A little less distance.":"msg.b6423b10c0e72b91","Bring the last story home  →":"msg.3f8b4f763a0a13a5","Follow the river  →":"msg.e6efbd297d3fcfde","ALL NINE LETTERS ARE HOME":"msg.e645cae8db200e3d","Every crossing begins with a small hello.":"msg.eaad75bb33f9ca04","The river keeps moving. Tonight, so do the stories.":"msg.5aee30026f223ecc","Read the letters":"msg.77ddfe2e5f7e0ebf","Stay by the river":"msg.c51381026c37b7cd","An imagined evening in Uzhhorod.":"msg.ae50ea0b68acef69","LETTERS FROM THE RIVER":"msg.7a32ab9613a23bf9"," / 9 home":"msg.00023830ed7dee0a","{v0} / 9 home":"msg.e93e98b68c2659bc","DELIVERED":"msg.d86760c54e3a46bc","ABOARD":"msg.ee1aab6c959276c9","ON THE RIVER":"msg.e72260b2179bbd3c","Safe in your satchel. Bring it to the landing with the matching seal.":"msg.b8d3d2865e616d45","A pale envelope is turning in the current.":"msg.f0c9e00804b1e9a2","Close":"msg.7d9eb7acb13e2462","THE RIVER CAN WAIT":"msg.ef0b6c489ea086e7","A moment on the bank.":"msg.0991e62bae89fd70","Tap or hold on the water to steer. On a keyboard, use WASD or the arrows. Space slows the boat. Recover a letter, then tap its matching landing or press E nearby.":"msg.59ba1e06a7c2dd61","No timer. No lost letters. Take your time.":"msg.0c199d625fe39502","Return to the water":"msg.8d96a9fe4303a500","Gentle current: on":"msg.4147f06f9bb0b6af","Gentle current: off":"msg.255427566d0cdc82","Sound: off":"msg.026e9e725e58d5e3","Sound: on":"msg.1b0c800b4a34381b","Start over":"msg.5eed7e9fc8f3cd68","Begin again?":"msg.bf1a5280f5448ac3","This starts a new river journey and clears these nine deliveries.":"msg.ea3eaf9381a40bad","Keep this journey":"msg.dae73045457f81a6","Start a new journey":"msg.5876436dfc544e08","The bookshop":"msg.8e1706b28b923a71","The garden":"msg.6be8b8e7840c175f","The last light":"msg.3d42d774eb2ca789","Could not prepare river scene:":"msg.3c9800012912ff40"},"patterns":[{"source":"A letter for {v0}.","id":"msg.8315466a09b15ba0","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"Sail to {v0}","id":"msg.abe6d202ca44260f","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"{v0} / 3 letters home","id":"msg.0fde9914d41c9efd","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"{v0} / 3 home","id":"msg.6867f26e63bf13b9","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"CHAPTER 0{v0}","id":"msg.11905be4d0405960","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"LETTER 0{v0}","id":"msg.c2a964d8be27d23f","protectedVariables":[]},{"source":"{v0} / 9 home","id":"msg.e93e98b68c2659bc","protectedVariables":[]}]}
